### API REST - Vitalis Pulse
### Arquivo para testar as rotas com REST Client (VS Code Extension)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ====================================================
# COMPANIES
# ====================================================

### Listar todas as empresas
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies

### Buscar empresa por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/10

### Criar nova empresa
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nova Empresa LTDA",
  "domain": "novaempresa.com.br"
}

### Atualizar empresa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp Solutions Updated",
  "domain": "techcorp-updated.com"
}

### Atualizar apenas o nome
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/companies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp Solutions - New Name"
}

### Deletar empresa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/companies/3

# ====================================================
# USERS
# ====================================================

### Listar todos os usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Criar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo.usuario@techcorp.com",
  "name": "Novo Usuário",
  "password": "senha123",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE",
  "companyId": 1
}

### Atualizar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Silva Atualizado",
  "isActive": true
}

### Deletar usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/6

# ====================================================
# INVITATIONS
# ====================================================

### Listar todos os convites
GET {{baseUrl}}/invitations

### Buscar convite por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invitations/1

### Criar novo convite
POST {{baseUrl}}/invitations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "convidado@example.com",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE",
  "companyId": 1
}

### Atualizar convite
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invitations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}

### Deletar convite
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invitations/3
